title=\"北瓜\">北瓜</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8B%A6%E7%93%9C\" title=\"苦瓜\">苦瓜</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%99%BD%E7%93%9C\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"白瓜\">白瓜</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8C%84%E5%AD%90\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"茄子\">茄瓜</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%91%AB%E8%98%86\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"葫蘆\">葫蘆</a>（瓠瓜）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BD%9B%E6%89%8B%E7%93%9C\" title=\"佛手瓜\">佛手瓜</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E7%B5%B2%E7%93%9C\" title=\"金絲瓜\">金絲瓜</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"注釋\"><span id=\".E6.B3.A8.E9.87.8B\"></span>注釋</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%93%9C&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：注釋\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style><div class=\"reflist\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">《左傳·莊公八年》：「齊侯使連稱、管至父戍蔡丘、瓜時而往，曰：『及瓜而代』」。</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"延伸阅读\"><span id=\"